# Vibe Plan Rules for Cursor

When the user needs a structured business launch plan or marketing roadmap:
1. Use files-first architecture: `plans/<slug>/plan.md` + `phase-01-*.md` to `phase-04-*.md`.
2. Standard 4 phases: Phase 1 Offer & Positioning, Phase 2 Assets & Content, Phase 3 Funnel & Checkout, Phase 4 Launch & Outreach.
3. Include tangible deliverable checklists, observable commercial verification tests, and risk scorecards.
